[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576203311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101237#issuecomment-2576203311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101237","id":2576203311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zjb4v","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T20:55:21Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T20:59:46Z","body":"With the `ProjectSettings.settings_changed` signal, you could likely make it so that all Jolt settings are cached on start, and re-read only when settings change, which would still allow modifying them at runtime.\r\n\r\nInstead of having getters that are just aliases for querying project settings, they could get the cached value / be direct accesses to a struct with all settings as members.\r\n\r\nThere's somewhat of a pattern with that signal in some editor plugins already:\r\n```cpp\r\nProjectSettings::get_singleton()->connect(\"settings_changed\", callable_mp(this, &CanvasItemEditor::_project_settings_changed));\r\n```\r\nYou can also check `ThemeCache` structs for reference (based on `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`, but the idea is the same).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576203311/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576350227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101237#issuecomment-2576350227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101237","id":2576350227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zj_wT","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T22:28:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T22:28:48Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576350227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576379496","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101237#issuecomment-2576379496","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101237","id":2576379496,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZkG5o","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T22:54:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T22:54:41Z","body":"> With the ProjectSettings.settings_changed signal, you could likely make it so that all Jolt settings are cached on start, and re-read only when settings change, which would still allow modifying them at runtime.\n\nThat does sound a lot cleaner, and should be a quick enough change. I'll throw together a PR for it.\n\nThanks for the tip!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576379496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576506027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101237#issuecomment-2576506027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101237","id":2576506027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zklyr","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T01:02:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T01:02:08Z","body":"I went ahead and made the suggested change in #101254.\r\n\r\nI set the milestone to `4.x`, since it seemed mildly risky in terms of amount of files touched, but the change was pretty mechanical, so I would say it's probably safe `4.4` as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576506027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]